  `set_option linter.unusedSectionVars false` is replaced by the pin's own `omit [Γ.FiniteIndex] in`
  on the six declarations that do not use the instance. One engine helper is shared rather than
  transcribed twice: the pin's `exists_isParabolicHom_apply_eq_periodOf` is also a private helper of
  the basis row above (`PeriodRealStructureOf.exists_isParabolicHom_apply_eq_periodOf`), and is
