  <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/aa2d8b3/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_basis_periodLatticeOf_linearIndependent_real_span_eq_top_of_isCongruenceSubgroup.lean>,
  <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/aa2d8b3/P2M/Sol/S_ModularCurve_exists_linearEquiv_parabolicHoms_dual_periodLatticeOf_apply_periodOf_of_isCongruenceSubgroup.lean>,
  <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/aa2d8b3/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_linearEquiv_parabolicHoms_dual_periodLatticeOf_apply_periodOf_of_isCongruenceSubgroup.lean>
